          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 5038,
            "text": "{\"video\":{\"url\":\"https://v3b.fal.media/files/b/0ab3e6c2/10CdpvjCJNZC7oiNKe_YO_minimax-h3.mp4\",\"content_type\":\"video/mp4\",\"file_name\":\"10CdpvjCJNZC7oiNKe_YO_minimax-h3.mp4\",\"file_size\":7785560},\"expanded_prompt\":\"subject_definitions:\\n<Subject 1> is the adult Caucasian man depicted across the 3x3 multi-view character turnaround panels in <Picture 1>, characterized by short, tousled light-brown hair, blue eyes, fair skin with subtle facial lines, an athletic lean build, an olive-green short-sleeved crew-neck T-shirt, black relaxed knee-length shorts, and black thong-style flip-flops.\\n\\nsummary:\\n[reference generation] On a rain-slicked Bangkok sidewalk during a light afternoon drizzle, <Subject 1> strolls forward toward a handheld smartphone camera while holding an open red umbrella overhead with a self-pleased smirk. Stepping onto a wet painted curb line, his flip-flop skids out, launching both feet into the air as he executes a classic silent-comedy pratfall and slams flat onto his back. The red umbrella pops from his hand, bounces once on the wet pavement, and rests upside down catching raindrops beside him, before <Subject 1> raises his head to stare directly into the lens with an unhurt, deadpan expression in one continuous shot.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - <Subject 1>'s physical identity, facial features, tousled light-brown hair, olive-green crew-neck T-shirt, black shorts, and black flip-flops are fully preserved from <Picture 1>. In accordance with user instructions, the 3x3 panel turnaround layout, grey studio background, and bicycle from <Picture 1> are omitted, and <Subject 1> is placed into a naturalistic rainy outdoor Bangkok sidewalk environment performing a slapstick pratfall.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\nThe target video is in realistic, vertical smartphone video style, exhibiting an authentic handheld mobile phone aesthetic with natural daylight and no cinematic color grading or CGI. Soft, diffused overcast light illuminates a damp Bangkok sidewalk during a light afternoon drizzle, creating glossy reflections across the wet pavement and asphalt while fine rain speckles the frame.\\n[Shot 1] The camera operates as a vertical handheld smartphone shot with slight natural Shake Slightly, framing a full-length view of a Bangkok sidewalk flanked by rain-slicked curbs and muted urban shopfronts in the background. Walking toward the camera along the sidewalk is <Subject 1>, an adult Caucasian man with short, tousled light-brown hair, blue eyes, fair skin, and an athletic build, dressed in a faded olive-green short-sleeved crew-neck T-shirt, relaxed black knee-length shorts, and black thong-style flip-flops. <Subject 1> strolls forward at a jaunty, confident pace, holding a vibrant open red umbrella high in his right hand above his head. He wears an exaggeratedly smug, self-pleased smirk, subtly nodding to himself as drops of water bead on the taut red canopy. Audibly, the gentle patter of light rainfall on concrete and the rhythmic, damp scuff of his footsteps dominate the quiet street atmosphere. As <Subject 1> advances into a medium-full framing in the center of the frame, his right foot steps directly onto a wet, glossy painted curb stripe. His black flip-flop instantly loses traction with a sharp wet squeak, skidding violently forward across the slick paint. In a sudden, classic silent-comedy pratfall, both of his legs kick violently upward into the air, launching his entire body horizontal before gravity pulls him down. His grip snaps open, releasing the red umbrella, which pops upward into the air with rotating momentum. <Subject 1> slams flat onto his back against the wet concrete with a heavy, wet slapping thud, sending a visible splash of shallow puddle water spraying outward around his shoulders and hips. The camera instinctively jolts with a subtle Shake Strongly before recovering. Beside him, the red umbrella arcs downward, bounces once against the damp sidewalk with a hollow clatter, and comes to rest completely upside down beside his right arm, its inverted ribs immediately catching falling raindrops. <Subject 1> remains entirely motionless and sprawled flat on the ground for a silent comic beat, staring upward as rain patters around him. Slowly and deliberately, he raises his head off the wet pavement, furrowing his brow slightly and locking his eyes directly with the camera lens, delivering an entirely blank, deadpan stare that confirms he is uninjured, while distant city ambience and steady drizzle continue underneath without any dialogue or music.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nThe soundscape consists of natural, diegetic ambient audio recorded via smartphone in the rain, featuring the soft, continuous patter of afternoon drizzle on pavement and umbrella fabric, the sharp rubbery skid of a flip-flop on wet paint, the heavy wet thud of a body slapping onto the sidewalk, the light plastic bounce of the umbrella, and distant muted Bangkok street traffic.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nN/A\"}"
